# Push updates to GitHub

After changing this codebase, commit the update and push it to `https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/Rival-Tracker.git` on `main`.

Keep these out of every commit: `data/`, `node_modules/`, `.env`, and `Etherscan APIs.txt`. Never commit API keys or the SQLite database.

Do not change git config. Do not force-push.
